//Item List for the Framework to use.
//All items must be placed within these categories.
//***-Flat means the Stat is modified by the added flat number, ***-Percentage means that the Stat is modified by it's own percentage.
// The "-*-" can't be i names. Also the (4-10) means that the item statistic group can only appear in items with at least lvl 4... but tops 10
//So if you need a modifier that should apper after itemlevel 5 to everyhting you should make a Group-*-5-MAXITEMLEVEL  group.
//The bigger the number the more common the item.
{
      "Helmet":
      {
              "BaseItem":
              {
                       "LeatherCap":
                      {
                        "LevelRequirement" : 1,
                        "Rarity" : 1
                      }
              },
                
                
